Module 1 — Python Foundations
Learn the fundamentals of Python, set up the development environment, and write your first programs.

Module 2 — Data & Variables
Understand how Python stores and works with different kinds of data.

Module 3 — Operators & Logic
Learn how to perform calculations, comparisons, and build logical expressions.

Module 4 — Decision Making & Loops
Learn how to make programs take decisions and repeat tasks efficiently.

Module 5 — Functions & Problem Solving
Learn to create reusable code, manage program structure, and solve problems using functions.